{"reviewId": "316739195_84QZajBg8", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "现在中国经济是处在同时包含了滞胀、通缩、回升和结构性增长的局面吧。内需严重不足，消费能力差，PPI指数为负，传统工业和房地产行业寒冬；但经济又没有全面萎缩，CPI指数回升，高端装备制造业和高技术制造业还有文旅产业强劲增长，物价也未陷入持续性的全面下跌。冰火两重天，现在是结构性转型与周期性压力并存的时代。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "4712-4780", "abstract": "康波从萧条向回升的转换本质上就是从滞胀向通缩的转换，此时经济增速不断下降，商品价格明显回落，通缩成为社会的共识，这个过程也有10年之久。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "316739195_84QZajBg8", "userVid": 316739195, "topics": [], "createTime": 1763816952, "userEditTime": 1763824075, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 316739195, "name": "yunnyshu", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0011-n~SWn5FnO9rRR1Ux94Xtbd3/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "23", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "博学、自由", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-100", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 106, "likes": [{"userVid": 289854799, "name": "、", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/vodqwjHqCTObb4iarvLTfZTW8VJWNy1XwFW2th5daMVzUtwDribUicAwoiaeF9ohUJoMSXrAM39cibaVqxbQu5TicqZtQEApRibmu6tVaDWEYKFnYU/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 4, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "联想到以前读书教的产业转型。目前国家的传统行业已经处于冰点时期，就需要进行产